# Copy to .env.local. Server-only values: never prefix a secret with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Details and official sources: docs/integrations/.

# Where the local SQLite store lives. Default .data/ inside this worktree.
# AA_DATA_DIR=.data

# Optional. Raises Hugging Face limits and allows gated models this account can read.
# HF_TOKEN=

# Teacher chat and the Nebius fine-tuning path.
# NEBIUS_API_KEY=
# NEBIUS_TEACHER_MODEL=

# Required before a paid run. Nebius does not publish fine-tuning prices,
# so an operator enters them. See docs/integrations/nebius.md for the format.
# NEBIUS_FINE_TUNING_USD_PER_1M_TOKENS_JSON=
# AA_TRAINING_MAX_USD=
